# The Emissary in Northern San d'Oria at status 0 (the mission current, 2-3): Baraka, Helaku and Shakir play their own
# scripts' events (539, 541, 538: no section arm); at status 1 (a GM): Helaku plays 676, Shakir 556, Baraka 581, whose
# finish ends The Emissary and begins The Emissary Sandoria at status 2. Rival zone-in, another mission's script: the
# login in Northern San d'Oria plays Seekers of Adventure's Rumors from the West onZoneIn, which returns 878.
lists NorthernSanDoria/Baraka/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/Helaku/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/Shakir/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/537 NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/581
char zone=NorthernSanDoria pos=36,-2,-2 job=WAR lvl=30 nation=1
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Bastok TheEmissary current
login
trigger Baraka
finish-if-event
trigger Helaku
finish-if-event
trigger Shakir
finish-if-event
missionstatus Bastok 1
trigger Helaku
finish-if-event
trigger Shakir
finish-if-event
trigger Baraka
finish
